<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     § 02 · PROBLEM
══════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="section-alt">
  <h2 class="cs-h2-wide">Four spaces. One evidence source. Zero coherent path.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">PMs had no end-to-end workflow. Every space packaged the same customer data differently but nothing connected them.</p>

  <div class="disconnect">
    <div class="d-node">Search Trends</div>
    <span class="d-arr">→</span>
    <div class="d-node">Search Customers</div>
    <span class="d-arr">→</span>
    <div class="d-node">Search Evidence</div>
    <span class="d-arr">→</span>
    <div class="d-node dest">Prioritize for Roadmap</div>
    <span class="no-path">✕ No path</span>
  </div>

  <div class="quote-grid">
    <div class="q-card">
      <blockquote>"A lot of the data is hidden in endless lists of ideas. Too many ideas in the backlog with little way to know what's valuable."</blockquote>
      <cite>— Neta &amp; Ori, Tipalti · JTBD interviews</cite>
    </div>
    <div class="q-card">
      <blockquote>"Current tools reflect only what PMs already consider — no idea generation support."</blockquote>
      <cite>— Carmel, HoneyBook · JTBD interviews</cite>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

