══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <h2 class="cs-h2-wide">The most powerful space was barely used.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Discovery had the highest potential — but nearly no traction. The Ideas page carried almost all weekly engagement while Discovery sat at near-zero.</p>

  <div class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-n">248</div>
      <div class="stat-l">Total Discovery queries across all accounts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-n">4.4<span class="stat-d">%</span></div>
      <div class="stat-l">Of queries converted to an idea — the core intended action</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-n">~140</div>
      <div class="stat-l">Avg. weekly Idea page views, vs. near-zero for Discovery</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bagel-callout">
    <p>Users look for proactive insights — asking Bagel to surface trends, themes, and segments that need attention. They already know what their problem is; they need Bagel to help them go deeper.</p>
    <cite>— Synthesis from user research</cite>
