<section class="section-alt">
  <h2 class="cs-h2-wide">Mapping PM workflows from the ground up.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Before touching the product, we mapped the PM's world — how they actually think, what jobs they need to do, and how their quarterly cycle works.</p>

  <div class="img-frame" style="margin-top:48px;">
