  <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:24px;">From empty state to structured insight.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">A PM opens a new Discovery session, types a question scoped to their evidence, and receives a ranked list of themes — each with weighted ARR, customer count, and evidence. The whole flow takes under 30 seconds.</p>

