<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     § 06 · DESIGN DECISION 01
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <span class="decision-mono">Design Decision 01</span>
  <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px;">Hierarchy over navigation.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Instead of navigating between separate pages, information unfolds in layers within one view: Theme → Sub-theme → Evidence. PMs move deeper without losing context or having to retrace their steps. The insight view header always shows where you are — and a single tap opens a searchable index of every insight in the session.</p>
  <div class="bagel-principle" style="max-width:600px;">The user never needs to navigate to find more — they drill down into what they're already looking at.</div>
  <div class="img-frame" style="margin-top:48px;">
    <img src="/images/bagel-04.png" alt="Hierarchy — drill-down insight view" style="border: none;">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     § 06 · DESIGN DECISION 02
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="feat-split">
    <div>
      <span class="decision-mono">Design Decision 02</span>
      <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px;">Every surface knows what you're looking at.</h2>
      <p class="body-text">Actions and follow-up questions are scoped to their context — not global. Asking a question on the Business Impact widget queries only that widget's data. Acting on an insight — creating an idea, adding to an existing one, duplicating — happens in place, without switching views. The product meets the PM where they are, not the other way around.</p>
      <div class="bagel-principle" style="max-width:600px;">Context-aware questions. Context-aware actions. No dead ends.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="img-frame">
      <img src="/images/bagel-05.png" alt="Context-aware actions — widget-level interactions" style="border: none; max-width: 600px;">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     § 06 · DESIGN DECISION 03
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <span class="decision-mono">Design Decision 03</span>
  <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px;">The artifact fits the PM, not the other way around.</h2>
  <p class="body-text" style="max-width:600px;">The insight view isn't a fixed report. PMs can ask follow-up questions scoped to any widget, or extend the view by adding new widgets from a library — Customer segments, Source type, Trend over time, Custom widget, and more. Every PM shapes the view to match how they think and what they need to defend.</p>
  <div class="bagel-principle" style="max-width:600px;">A shared artifact that everyone can make their own.</div>

  <div class="two-frame-strip">
    <div class="frame-item">
      <div class="frame-n">Ask AI</div>
      <img src="/images/bagel-07.png" alt="Ask AI follow-up questions">
      <div class="frame-cap">Follow-up questions scoped to any widget — suggested prompts adapt to widget type</div>
    </div>
    <div class="frame-item">
      <div class="frame-n">Add widget</div>
      <img src="/images/bagel-08b.png" alt="Add widget from library">
      <div class="frame-cap">Choose from a library or build a custom widget from scratch</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     FLOW 02 · INSIGHT VIEW
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section-alt">
  <span class="flow-mono">Flow 02 · Insight view</span>
  <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:24px;">An insight card is a live workspace, not a dead end.</h2>
  <p class="body-text">Clicking an insight card from the chat opens the expanded insight view — a split screen where the conversation stays live on the left and the card becomes an interactive artifact on the right. Widgets can be interrogated, filtered, and extended without leaving the view.</p>

